 extraHTML:'<div class="pg-section" style="--accent-color:#34d399"><div style="text-align:center;padding:12px;margin-bottom:20px;background:rgba(#34d399,0.1);border:1px dashed #34d399;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:#34d399"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Este e um exemplo de catálogo de energia solar � imagens ilustrativas.</div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:32px"><div style="background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px"><h4 style="font-family:var(--fp);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:12px">Simulador de Economia</h4><label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted)">Sua conta de luz atual (R$):</label><input type="range" min="100" max="3000" value="500" class="solar-range" style="width:100%;margin:12px 0" oninput="document.getElementById(\'solarVal\').textContent=\'R$ \'+parseInt(this.value).toLocaleString(\'pt-BR\');document.getElementById(\'solarEcon\').textContent=\'R$ \'+Math.round(this.value*0.95).toLocaleString(\'pt-BR\')" /><div style="text-align:center"><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted)">Sua conta</div><div style="font-family:var(--fp);font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#34d399" id="solarVal">R$ 500</div></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px"><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted)">Economia mensal</div><div style="font-family:var(--fp);font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#34d399" id="solarEcon">R$ 475</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)">*Economia de até 95%</div></div></div><div style="background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px"><h4 style="font-family:var(--fp);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:12px">Comparador de Kits</h4><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)"><div><div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Kit 2kWp</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)">2 placas e Microinversor</div></div><div style="text-align:right"><div style="font-weight:800;color:#34d399">R$ 4.990</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)">Economia: R$ 190/mês</div></div></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)"><div><div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Kit 5kWp</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)">5 placas e Microinversor e String</div></div><div style="text-align:right"><div style="font-weight:800;color:#34d399">R$ 9.990</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)">Economia: R$ 475/mês</div></div></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)"><div><div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Kit 10kWp</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)">10 placas e Inversor trifásico</div></div><div style="text-align:right"><div style="font-weight:800;color:#34d399">R$ 18.990</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)">Economia: R$ 950/mês</div></div></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);opacity:0.6"><div><div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Kit 15kWp</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)">15 placas? Inversor industrial</div></div><div style="text-align:right"><div style="font-weight:800;color:#34d399">R$ 26.990</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)">Economia: R$ 1.420/mês</div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><h3 style="font-family:var(--fp);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px">Catálogo de Kits Solares</h3><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;marg